  "claims": [
    "P3.1. In a new project, rules_check.py init then test exits 0 and prints 0 wrong with the copy of either plugin; with dvt-milestone's it prints one skip: line naming the rule about plans.",
    "P3.2. A rule that names a fact type nobody has and is not about plans is still wrong, with or without the phase tool.",
    "P3.3. With the phase tool present, rules_check.py test prints and exits exactly as before this diff, and gnd synth is given the same rules.",
    "P3.4. A settings file that rules_check.py, components_index.py, review_tool.py or handoff.py cannot use, for any command, exits 2 with the reason on standard error and no traceback; a working settings file changes nothing.",
    "P3.4b. phase_tool.py with such a file prints exactly one envelope with ok false and error code SETTINGS, exit 2, for every command including status, and the module can still be loaded by a caller that reads its tables.",
    "P3.5. Each changed docstring sentence says what the code does.",
    "P3.6. rules_check.py, review_tool.py and handoff.py and their copies under plugins/ have no finding under ruff 0.16.2 with the configuration pull request 34 names.",
    "coder_pool.py is left at exit 1 for a settings file, and the spec's reason for that (D1) is true of its code and docstring."
  ],
